message: "If you use Ernie for published research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Ernie: Efficient Renderer for Natural and Interplanetary Environments"
abstract: >-
  Ernie is a physically-based, real-time, spectral renderer for planetary robotics and
  sensing, with C++ and Python APIs.
